sequenceDiagram
  participant Orders
  participant Payment
  participant Inventory
  actor Operator
  Orders->>Payment: refund stable operation
  Payment-->>Orders: refund receipt
  Orders->>Orders: persist refund completion
  Orders->>Inventory: register exact return unit manifest (worker scope)
  Inventory-->>Orders: stable receipt operation
  Operator->>Inventory: inspect every registered unit with expected revision
  Inventory->>Inventory: atomically audit decisions and restock sellable units only
  Inventory-->>Operator: inspection receipt and new revision
  Note over Orders,Inventory: Inventory owns stock and inspection; no private table reads
  Note over Inventory: Damaged/disputed units remain unavailable; refund remains final
